    "source": {
      "value": "lopsg"
    },
    "description": {
      "value": "These specialized pieces of footwear are designed to distribute the wearer's weight over a larger area to prevent them from sinking while walking on snow. They are typically made with a wood frame and rawhide lacings that are tied over the wearer's other footwear. While wearing snowshoes, you ignore the effects of non-magical difficult terrain caused by snow (reducing greater difficult terrain from snow to ordinary difficult terrain). You take a –10-foot item penalty to your Speed if wearing snowshoes while walking on any surface other than snow."
